#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:166
#: 7867249881ee4ba885e8948513cbe4ca
msgid "跑完检查什么"
msgstr "What to check after sampling"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:168
#: 84261b93eccd41f096dbad7d284bdac0
msgid "看实际选择数量是否因“最小距离”或覆盖 $R^2$ 阈值提前停止，并核对界面报告的最终覆盖分数。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the actual selection count stopped early because of the "
"minimum distance or coverage-$R^2$ threshold, and verify the final "
"coverage score reported by the UI."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:169
#: a60ff3286d4e4deeb336fff383de850b
msgid "看元素集合平衡模式是否覆盖了预期的每个元素集合。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether element-set-balanced mode covered every expected element "
"set."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:170
#: 119acb34529846fabdab8a8f2366b27c
msgid ""
"对 spin 模型，核对物理平衡模式是否覆盖了预期的元素集合、BCC/FCC 和磁序分层；不同浓度由元素比例与局域环境覆盖体现。BCC 的 TC "
"通过不能替代 FCC 独立验证。"
msgstr ""
"For spin models, check the expected element sets, BCC/FCC phases and spin"
" categories. Element fractions and local environments capture "
"concentration variation. Successful BCC TC validation does not replace "
"independent FCC validation."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:171
#: abf554ecb41f4776a4fc90c937cebe39
msgid "有训练集时，看叠加图中新样本是否落在训练集空白区域，而不是大量堆在已有训练点附近。"
msgstr ""
"When a training set is provided, use the overlay plot to verify that new "
"samples fill uncovered regions instead of clustering around existing "
"training points."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:172
#: ed2eeb7af68b4da6bce30d2a05486fcd
msgid "回到结构视图抽查代表点；描述符距离大可能来自真实新环境，也可能来自坏结构。"
msgstr ""
"Return to the structure view and inspect representative samples; a large "
"descriptor distance may indicate a genuinely new environment or a "
"malformed structure."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:173
#: f42d729168d0480bb6fbab5037efaae1
msgid "使用“当前选择作为区域”时，删除前确认：**仍被选中的才是准备删除的冗余点**。"
msgstr ""
"When using “Use current selection as region”, confirm before deletion "
"that **the points still selected are the redundant structures to "
"remove**."

#~ msgid "强制使用原始描述符和固定数量模式；样本上限不得小于实际物理分层数"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Requires raw descriptors and fixed-count"
#~ " mode; the sample limit must be "
#~ "at least the number of observed "
#~ "physical strata"

#~ msgid "限制最多选择多少结构；`0` 在覆盖 $R^2$ 模式表示允许用到全部候选；两种平衡策略要求正数"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Caps the number of selected structures;"
#~ " `0` allows all candidates in "
#~ "coverage-$R^2$ mode; both balanced strategies"
#~ " require a positive value"

#~ msgid "按元素集合、晶相和磁序建立物理分层，再根据局域环境描述符在层内 FPS"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Build physical strata by element set,"
#~ " phase, and magnetic order, then run"
#~ " FPS independently within each stratum"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "物理平衡策略复用 `Training Set Audit` "
#~ "的保守晶相和磁序识别。它先给每个已观察到的 "
#~ "“元素集合—晶相—磁序”分层一个名额，再按各层的描述符覆盖缺口和下一采样点的边际收益分配剩余预算。 `mixed` "
#~ "和 `unresolved` 会作为独立分层保留，不会被强行猜成 BCC 或 "
#~ "FCC。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The physics-balanced strategy reuses the"
#~ " conservative phase and magnetic-order "
#~ "classifiers from `Training Set Audit`. "
#~ "It first reserves one slot for "
#~ "every observed element-set--phase"
#~ "--magnetic-order stratum, then allocates "
#~ "the remaining budget according to each"
#~ " stratum's descriptor-coverage gap and "
#~ "the marginal gain of the next "
#~ "sample. `mixed` and `unresolved` remain "
#~ "separate strata instead of being forced"
#~ " into BCC or FCC."

#~ msgid "层内 FPS 并不只看一个结构平均描述符。物理平衡策略把以下连续证据分别归一化并按特征块平衡后， 拼成同一个代表性采样空间："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Within-stratum FPS does not rely "
#~ "on a single structure-averaged "
#~ "descriptor. The physics-balanced strategy "
#~ "normalizes and block-balances the "
#~ "following continuous evidence into one "
#~ "representative sampling space:"

#~ msgid "NEP 原子描述符的结构均值、标准差和最大局域偏离，用于同时保留整体环境、环境分布和少数极端局域环境；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The structure mean, standard deviation, "
#~ "and maximum local deviation of atomic"
#~ " NEP descriptors preserve the overall "
#~ "environment, its distribution, and rare "
#~ "extreme local environments."

#~ msgid "每原子体积、晶胞形状、夹角和周期性，用于显式保留体积、应变和晶格形状变化；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Volume per atom, cell shape, cell "
#~ "angles, and periodicity explicitly preserve"
#~ " volume, strain, and lattice-shape "
#~ "variation."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "spin 模型的磁矩大小与离散度、净磁矩比例、共线度、共面度、近邻关联以及经过晶胞换算和正负号等价处理的 "
#~ "`q_peak/q-vector` 证据。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For spin models, the features also "
#~ "include moment magnitude and spread, "
#~ "net-moment ratio, collinearity, coplanarity, "
#~ "nearest-neighbor correlation, and cell-"
#~ "aware, sign-equivalent `q_peak/q-vector` "
#~ "evidence."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这些连续证据只用于同一硬分层内部的距离；元素集合、晶相和磁序仍是不能被 FPS "
#~ "距离冲掉的硬分层。全局浓度不单独建立硬层，它通过不同局域化学环境在 NEP 描述符分布中体现。 "
#~ "若旧结果只有结构平均描述符、又没有可调用的 NEP calculator，软件会保留功能并退回“描述符均值 "
#~ "+ 晶格 + 磁性证据”， 但不会伪称已经比较了原子描述符的分布和尾部。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "These continuous features define distances "
#~ "only within the same hard stratum; "
#~ "element set, phase, and magnetic order"
#~ " remain hard strata that FPS "
#~ "distances cannot erase. Global concentration"
#~ " does not form a separate hard "
#~ "stratum; it is represented through "
#~ "different local chemical environments in "
#~ "the NEP descriptor distribution. If an"
#~ " older result contains only structure-"
#~ "averaged descriptors and no callable NEP"
#~ " calculator, sampling remains available "
#~ "with descriptor mean, lattice, and "
#~ "magnetic evidence, but the application "
#~ "does not claim to have compared "
#~ "atomic-descriptor distributions or tails."

#~ msgid "“自动描述符覆盖”模式不读取样本上限和最小距离。程序在每个元素集合—晶相—磁序层内按描述符覆盖目标独立确定数量，再把各层数量汇总并直接使用同一次分析得到的结构集合，不会先推荐数量后换一套分配算法重采样。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Automatic descriptor-coverage mode ignores "
#~ "the sample limit and minimum distance."
#~ " It determines a count independently "
#~ "in each element-set--phase--magnetic-"
#~ "order stratum from the descriptor-"
#~ "coverage target, sums the stratum "
#~ "counts, and directly uses the structures"
#~ " selected by that same analysis; it"
#~ " does not recommend a count and "
#~ "then resample with a different "
#~ "allocation algorithm."

#~ msgid "前者分配一个全局上限；后者由各物理层覆盖需求汇总数量"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The former allocates one global cap; "
#~ "the latter sums the counts required "
#~ "for coverage in each physical stratum"

#~ msgid "`元素集合 / 晶相 / 磁序 FPS`"
#~ msgstr "`Element-set / phase / magnetic-order FPS`"

#~ msgid "保护元素集合、晶相和磁序代表，联合覆盖真实原子环境与结构特征"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Protect element-set, phase and spin "
#~ "representatives while jointly covering atomic"
#~ " environments and structure features"

#~ msgid "FeNi 等体系同时存在浓度偏斜、BCC/FCC 和多种 spin 排列"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A single element set such as FeNi"
#~ " contains concentration imbalance, BCC/FCC "
#~ "phases, and multiple spin arrangements"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "距离尺度在完整可比较池上固定：结构按元素集合，原子按中心元素。拟合时去掉完全重复行，使用标准差和相对尺度下限，再按有效维数平衡。不会用某个磁序类别中很小的四分位距放大近常量特征。晶胞形状不作为独立证据，以免等价基矢或超胞造成虚假新颖性；应变信息由局域描述符保留。自动估计的波矢方向不再作为欧氏坐标；模型所表达的自旋方向信息仍在"
#~ " NEP 描述符内。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Distance scales are fixed across the "
#~ "comparable pool: by element set for "
#~ "structures and by central species for"
#~ " atoms. Exact duplicate rows are "
#~ "removed when fitting standard deviations "
#~ "and a relative scale floor, followed "
#~ "by active-dimension balancing. A tiny"
#~ " within-class interquartile range cannot"
#~ " amplify a nearly constant feature. "
#~ "Cell shape is not independent evidence"
#~ " because equivalent lattice bases and "
#~ "supercells can create false novelty; "
#~ "local descriptors retain strain information."
#~ " Automatically estimated wave-vector "
#~ "directions are no longer Euclidean "
#~ "coordinates; NEP descriptors retain the "
#~ "directional spin information expressed by "
#~ "the model."

#~ msgid "结果报告停止原因、未覆盖结构数和分辨率。达到数量或资源限制时，即使每个物理类别都有代表，也可能仍有未覆盖结构；不会报告为覆盖完成。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Results report the stopping reason, "
#~ "uncovered structure count and resolution. "
#~ "Reaching a sample or resource limit "
#~ "may leave coverage gaps even when "
#~ "every physical category has a "
#~ "representative; it is not reported as"
#~ " completed coverage."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "“自动局域环境覆盖”模式不读取样本上限和最小距离。它与固定数量模式共享同一条确定性选择序列，当全部候选的联合结构距离和局域环境距离都不超过归一化分辨率"
#~ " `0.25` 时停止。没有默认的每层 2048 帧上限，也不再使用总方差解释率判定物理覆盖。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Automatic local-environment coverage ignores"
#~ " the sample limit and minimum "
#~ "distance. It shares the deterministic "
#~ "selection trajectory of fixed-count "
#~ "sampling and stops when every candidate"
#~ " has joint structure and atomic-"
#~ "environment distances no greater than "
#~ "the normalized resolution `0.25`. There "
#~ "is no default 2048-frame per-stratum "
#~ "cap, and total explained variance no "
#~ "longer determines physical coverage."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "内部紧凑、均衡、保守分辨率分别为 `0.35/0.25/0.18`，表示不同几何细度，不能解释为训练精度。自动分析会暂停更新已在"
#~ " `0.18` "
#~ "内的原子环境距离，报告保守上界；手动数量模式若继续采到更细尺度，会恢复精确比较，不受这一自动分辨率限制。自动分析同时得到嵌套的数量范围；这不是训练所需最小数量的证明。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Internal compact, balanced, and conservative"
#~ " resolutions are `0.35/0.25/0.18`. They "
#~ "describe geometric detail, not training "
#~ "accuracy. Automatic analysis pauses distance"
#~ " updates for atomic environments already"
#~ " within `0.18` and reports conservative "
#~ "upper bounds. Manual-count sampling "
#~ "restores exact comparisons when proceeding "
#~ "to finer scales, so this automatic "
#~ "resolution does not restrict it. "
#~ "Automatic analysis also returns nested "
#~ "count ranges; these do not prove "
#~ "the minimum training-set size."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "输入状态还用于保护连续变化范围。程序在相同元素集合内，以八个不同近邻状态估计局部间距，对细密区域收紧输入距离。采样先保护输入区域的边界，再补充距离缺口，不为边界预留固定比例。整个过程不使用"
#~ " DFT 标签、来源名或材料名称。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Input states also protect continuous "
#~ "ranges. Within each element set, eight"
#~ " distinct neighbors estimate local spacing"
#~ " and tighten input distances in dense"
#~ " regions. Sampling protects input-region"
#~ " boundaries before filling distance gaps,"
#~ " without reserving a fixed fraction "
#~ "for boundaries. No DFT labels, source"
#~ " names, or material names enter this"
#~ " process."
